T* (7.1 LICENSE USAGE TELEMETRY) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The MSUO kernel uses an asynchronous, best-effort \("fire-and-forget"\)) Tj
T* (notification mechanism to inform the Licensor's analytics backend of) Tj
T* (license usage. Its purpose is to record the most recent known usage of) Tj
T* (a license and support aggregate license-usage analytics.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The notification is designed to operate independently of the primary) Tj
T* (application execution lifecycle. Failure to deliver an analytics) Tj
T* (notification does not, by itself, prevent or interrupt application) Tj
T* (execution or replace the kernel's license verification requirements.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Telemetry is intended to be limited to a pseudonymous license identifier) Tj
T* (and a last-usage timestamp. The telemetry mechanism must not transmit) Tj
T* (application payloads, business data, application source code, end-user) Tj
T* (content, passwords or private signing keys. Analytics results may be) Tj
T* (aggregated and anonymized. Where a license identifier or network metadata) Tj
T* (can be linked to an identifiable person, such information is treated as) Tj
T* (personal data rather than anonymous data.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Any processing of personal data is subject to applicable data protection) Tj
T* (law and the Licensor's applicable privacy notice, including information) Tj
T* (on purposes, legal basis, retention and data subject rights. Acceptance) Tj
T* (of this Agreement does not constitute consent to processing where) Tj
T* (separate consent is legally required.) Tj
